ompare/2.2.33-ls18...2.2.34-ls19","upstream":"### New\n- `bin/grav install --dev` and `bin/grav composer --dev` keep Composer's dev dependencies. Both commands always ran Composer with `--no-dev`, so running `bin/grav install` after a plain `composer install` removed the dev packages again [#4422](https://github.com/getgrav/grav/issues/4422)\n\n### Bugfix\n- The scheduler no longer forgets a job's last run when a slow run overlaps the next minute's run, which made hourly jobs that ran on time show as never having run\n- A browser that was signed in when its account was deleted is now signed out on its next request. Thanks to @inanna-malick for the report\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/getgrav/grav/releases/tag/2.2.34"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","PS1=$(whoami)@$(hostname):$(pwd)\\$ ","HOME=/root","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","PHP_INI_SCAN_DIR=:/config/php","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true"],"exposed_ports":["443/tcp","80/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/grav/builds/2.2.34-ls19.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/grav/builds/2.2.34-ls19/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/grav/builds/2.2.34-ls19/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/grav/builds/2.2.34-ls19/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-grav/releases/tag/2.2.34-ls19","pages":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-grav/builds/2.2.34-ls19/","files":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-grav/builds/2.2.34-ls19/files.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-grav/builds/2.2.34